  "details": "I would love to see the size limit increased for Quest atleast up to 15MB or 20MB\n\nThe 10MB limit is killing the creation process for Quest and has been giving me issues causing me to make my avatars look like pixelated garble for questies. What's the point in creating avatars when you're forced to make avatars look like garble. \n\nPersonally, I would say drop Quest 2 support or increase the size as it's a pain to deal with the 10MB limit.\n\nSDK Version\n\n3.7.4",
